        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Horace Ové, A. Edward Sutherland, Zak Ové, Indra Ové\n- Roles: filmmaker, photographer, painter, writer, film director, actor, actress\n\nFacts:\n- Albert Edward Sutherland was born on January 5, 1895, and he became a film director and actor.\n- Horace Ové was born in 1939 and is a British filmmaker, photographer, painter, and writer.\n- Horace Ové is considered one of the leading black independent filmmakers to emerge in Britain since the post-war period.\n- Albert Edward Sutherland died on December 31, 1973.\n- Zak Ové is the son of filmmaker Horace Ové.\n- Indra Ové is the sister of Zak Ové and is an actress.",
